From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nydal91 <nydal91@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 11:32:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 11/17] Run Vulkan evaluates made inside a render pass after it
 ends

Unity's plugin events reach NGX on a secondary command buffer continuing
a render pass, where compute work isn't allowed and Turnip silently
drops it. Keep such an evaluate and run it on the primary command buffer
right after its render pass ends.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01A9WqnwGsLAcGJXd49N2pes
